OL,3,GNEWSASecond person dies after
OL,4,Athree-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second person has died after a
OL,7,Fthree-vehicle crash last week.
OL,9,FThe 74-year-old woman had been taken to
OL,10,Fhospital with serious injuries
OL,11,Ffollowing the collision at the junction
OL,12,Fof Wretchwick Way and Peregrine Way in
OL,13,FBicester, Oxfordshire, at about 10:00
OL,14,FBST on 8 September.
OL,16,FShe was a passenger in a black Peugeot
OL,17,F106, whose 75-year-old driver died at
OL,18,Fthe scene. The crash also involved a
OL,19,Fblue Scania flatbed truck and a grey
OL,20,FHonda HR-V. The driver of the Honda
OL,21,Fsuffered minor injuries, but no-one
OL,22,Felse was hurt.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
